# Env files

- Android release signing: `apps/android/.env.example` (git-ignored; template in `apps/android/.env.template`). CI writes it from secrets.
- Desktop app settings live in `~/Library/Application Support/Pairspan/settings.json`, not in the repo.
- The Supabase URL and publishable key in `crates/core/src/signal.rs` and `apps/android/.../link/Realtime.kt` are public by design; never add a secret or service-role key.

Never commit keystores, ADB keys or device identifiers.
